      "writtenOn": "2019-10-01T23:24:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Subtraction of two pointers seems to result in a long int. If I try with %d, I get:\ncore/minute-ia/task.c:256:11: error: format \u0027%d\u0027 expects argument of type \u0027int\u0027, but argument 4 has type \u0027long int\u0027 [-Werror\u003dformat\u003d]\n   CPRINTF(\"[%d -\u003e %d]\\n\",",
      "parentUuid": "b66fa626_a37f0809",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 256,
